{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `log_radon`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: replaced the manual likelihood accumulation `target += normal_lpdf(log_radon[n] | mu[n], sigma_y)` inside the loop with a single built-in vectorized sampling statement `log_radon ~ normal(mu, sigma_y)`. The linear predictor `mu` is still computed deterministically before the observation statement. No data fields were changed or added.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=0> J;
  int<lower=0> N;
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=J> county_idx;
  vector[N] log_uppm;
  vector[N] floor_measure;
  vector[N] log_radon;
}
parameters {
  vector[J] alpha;
  vector[2] beta;
  real mu_alpha;
  real<lower=0> sigma_alpha;
  real<lower=0> sigma_y;
}
model {
  vector[N] mu;
  vector[N] muj;

  sigma_alpha ~ normal(0, 1);
  sigma_y ~ normal(0, 1);
  mu_alpha ~ normal(0, 10);
  beta ~ normal(0, 10);

  alpha ~ normal(mu_alpha, sigma_alpha);
  for (n in 1 : N) {
    muj[n] = alpha[county_idx[n]] + log_uppm[n] * beta[1];
    mu[n] = muj[n] + floor_measure[n] * beta[2];
  }
  log_radon ~ normal(mu, sigma_y);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"J":1,"N":3,"county_idx":[1,1,1],"floor_measure":[6.403559775811956,5.944985864699174,5.282108979178419],"log_radon":[2.4575413126072796,5.660034929112994,4.077749616152959],"log_uppm":[5.936865335753828,3.2711835183617866,3.7552708926366445]}","protected_variables":["log_radon"]}
